# Enterprise Linux 9 predates the pseudo-file xattr support added in
# squashfs-tools 4.6.  Its package buildroot compiles this pinned upstream
# release when a labelled live image is requested; newer releases keep using
# the mksquashfs shipped by their image-tools set.
